(text "Corrected from the 2007 printout:\n- U3 DIR line (from DT/R): the dots on all eight A0-A7\n  rows would short DIR to the data bus; removed.\n- RST from 8284 pin 10 (RESET out), not pin 11 (~{RES} in).\n- INTR (18) from 8259 INT (17), not ground; QS1/~{INTA} (24)\n  to 8259 INTA (26), not an open stub (Fig 6, IR7 timer\n  interrupt in skeet.asm)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 168.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "e377fba4-d022-4352-8e94-c7d8011c4ee1"))
(text "Figure 1: Microprocessor\nSubsystem" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 26.67 187.96 90) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) (bold yes)) (justify left)) (uuid "1d5952a4-b3c4-44bc-9405-8c66619428f5"))
